 "version": 1,
 "title": "A sprint board whose tickets move on with a tap",
 "prompt": "Make a kanban sprint board with To do, In progress and Done columns, each with a count. Each ticket shows its type as a coloured tag, the title, its id, the assignee's avatar and story points. Tapping a ticket moves it to the next column. On a phone show one column at a time with tabs; on a tablet or desktop show all columns side by side.",
