 "teaches": [
  "One Board call: columns as {title, color, cards}, each ticket {title, subtitle: id, tag, tone, who, value: points}. About 3 KB of JSON for the whole adaptive board",
  "A tap moves a ticket to the next column with no app round trip: the counts in the tabs and headers follow; Done keeps its tickets",
  "Phone: tabs To do / In progress / Done with counts over one full-width column. From 600 dp: the three columns side by side, centred, 240 to 340 dp each",
  "headerEnd holds an IconButton that sends newTicket to the app"
 ],
