  "describe": "Phone: Sprint 24 · Checkout with a + button, tabs To do 4, In progress 3, Done 2 (To do underlined), four tickets with a Feature, Bug, Analytics or Content tag, title, CHK id, avatar and points on a grey column. 640x360: To do and In progress side by side and part of Done, scrolling sideways. 1280x800: the three columns centred under the title with dots and counts 4, 3, 2; Crash when the promo code is empty says Overdue in red. 800x1280: three columns filling the width. phone-move: after a tap on the first ticket and the In progress tab, In progress 4 shows Apple Pay button on the cart page first; To do 3. desktop-move: Apple Pay in In progress, counts 3, 4, 2.",
